#. type: TH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "13 Jul 2008"
msgstr "13 iulie 2008"

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "NAME"
msgstr "NUME"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid "sane-mustek_pp - SANE backend for Mustek parallel port flatbed scanners"
msgstr ""
"sane-mustek_pp - controlor SANE pentru scanerele plate Mustek cu port paralel"

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "DESCRIERE"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid ""
"The B<sane-mustek_pp> library implements a SANE (Scanner Access Now Easy) "
"backend that provides access to Mustek parallel port flatbed scanners and "
"OEM versions."
msgstr ""
"Biblioteca B<sane-mustek_pp> implementează un controlor SANE (Scanner Access "
"Now Easy) care oferă acces la scanerele plate cu port paralel Mustek și la "
"versiunile OEM."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid ""
"There are 2 classes of Mustek parallel port scanners: regular B<CCD> (cold "
"cathode device) scanners and B<CIS> (contact image sensor) scanners."
msgstr ""
"Există 2 clase de scanere Mustek cu port paralel: scanere obișnuite B<CCD> "
"(dispozitiv cu catod rece) și scanere B<CIS> (senzor de imagine cu contact)."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid ""
"The current version of this backend supports both CCD type scanners and CIS "
"type scanners."
msgstr ""
"Versiunea actuală a acestui controlor acceptă atât scanere de tip CCD, cât "
"și scanere de tip CIS."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid "The following scanners might work with this backend:"
msgstr "Următoarele scanere ar putea funcționa cu acest controlor:"

#. type: SS
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "CCD scanners"
msgstr "Scanere CCD"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
